', 'CPython 3.13.18', 1, 'VERIFIED', UTC_TIMESTAMP(6), 'Executed on 13 tests (3 public examples + 10 hidden) with CPython 3.13.18. The stored expected outputs come from this program; the independent Python and C++ references produced identical token output on every test, and every example''s stated output matched. Verified by catalog/build.py.' FROM problems p WHERE p.slug = 'first-unique-character';
